  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n4 × 0.4 × 0.04 × 0.004 × 40\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\nProduct of numbers\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n4 × 0.4 = 1.6\n\n1.6 × 0.04 = 0.064\n\n0.064 × 0.004 = 0.000256\n\n0.000256 × 40 = 0.01024\n\n**The value of 4 × 0.4 × 0.04 × 0.004 × 40 is 0.01024.**",
